# `@cmp/{{dashCase name}}` Engineering Constitution

## 1. Pure Functional Core (`ADR-007`)
- Keep domain rules, data transformations, and state transitions in `src/` as **pure, stateless functions** with zero network, filesystem, or UI side effects.
- Use strict TypeScript (`"strict": true` via `@cmp/config/tsconfig.library.json`). Never use `@ts-ignore` or `any`.

## 2. Dependency Boundaries
- This library lives under `packages/{{dashCase name}}` and may depend only on `packages/*` (`workspace:*`).
- Never import from `apps/*` (enforced by `.dependency-cruiser.cjs` and `@cmp/config/eslint`).

## 3. Verification Gate
Before any change is considered complete, all of the following must pass:
- `pnpm --filter @cmp/{{dashCase name}} lint`
- `pnpm --filter @cmp/{{dashCase name}} typecheck`
- `pnpm --filter @cmp/{{dashCase name}} build`
- `pnpm --filter @cmp/{{dashCase name}} test`
